So weekYear = weekOfYear(...).year. For en-gb with dow=1, doy=4: 2021-01-01 is Friday. firstWeekOffset(2021,1,4): fwd = 7 + dow - doy = 7+1-4=4; fwdlw = (7 + createUTCDate(2021,0,4).getUTCDay() - dow) % 7. Jan 4 2021 is Monday, getUTCDay=1. (7+1-1)%7 = 0. So weekOffset = -0 + 4 = 4. dayOfYear for Jan 1 = 1. week = floor((1 - 4 - 1)/7)+1 = floor(-4/7)+1 = -1+1 = 0. week < 1 → recurse on 2020-01-01. 2020: fwdlw = (7 + Jan4 2020 getUTCDay - 1)%7. Jan 4 2020 is Saturday, getUTCDay=6 → (7+6-1)%7 = 12%7=5. weekOffset = -5+4 = -1. dayOfYear Jan 1 = 1. week = floor((1-(-1)-1)/7)+1 = floor(1/7)+1 = 0+1 = 1. weeksInYear(2020,1,4): let's compute = 53. So resYear=2020, week=1. So moment gives weekYear 2020. Good.

Now dayjs weekYear implementation:
```js
